  "prefLabel": "Rev 601.08 Base year",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 601.08 “Base year” means the tax year in which the municipality performed a revaluation of all properties.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 600) #10581, eff 5-1-14; ss by #13916, eff 3-28-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 600)",
